Z||000000||hutch84fierose||12-03-2001||12:25 PM||||I noticed that there is a few questions about seats on the forum right now.  The Question I have is does anyone have a list or help me out which seats from other cars will fit into the fiero then.  I have been really working on my fiero I want to do alot of things to the car this winter.  The fiero is gonna have a good christmas.  <BR>I went and measured the seats in my parents car and the new cavalier seats i think will fit by the new grand am seats will not they are too wide.  May have to change the tracks under the seat but thats no big deal.<BR>anywyas thanks for the help fellow fiero owners||||reg||6
Z||000001||deceler8||12-03-2001||02:26 PM||||I used Grand Am seats (mine are from a '91).<P>They're cheap and plentiful, but you do have to use your Fiero tracks (they bolt right on).<P>You'll likely find that nearly all GM compact/intermediate buckets will fit, but will require you use the Fiero seat tracks.<P>I got a set of grey Grand Am buckets for $50 and they are very similar in appearance to the Fiero seats except the headrest is adjustable on the Grand Am seats. They are a perfect fit and look perfectly normal in the Fiero. They're a little softer than the Fiero seats and have a little better lateral support as well.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Her86GT||12-03-2001||03:03 PM||||98 sunfire GT seats in mine, has adjustable dr seat lumbar suport too.  Fit right on fiero adjusters, and I did it all myself.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar2sm.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||hutch84fierose||12-04-2001||03:06 PM||||thanks for the help no i have an idea what to go and look for.  Is there any other seats that will fit for sure.  I have made a few calls and a guy asked what i was doing witht he seats because people with old hot rods are buying them up because of the speakers in the headrest.  They are paying good money.  I just said i need to find some seats first.  I have redone my whole interior except for the seats.  I painted everything, new steering wheel, pedal covers, new dash the works just these darn seats. They are so bad there is spots where the bar is showing.  I was wondering if there is any more thanks again||||reg||14
Z||000004||deceler8||12-04-2001||03:19 PM||||There's lots of seats that will physically fit in the car, but will require some modification to fit...you'll either have to install ew mounting points or fab the seats to use the Fiero tracks.<P>When I was looking, there were quite a few Geo Storms in the yard and that car has really nice seats, but would have required some work to mount, so I went with the Grand Am seats. If you have the time and the ability, Geo Storm seats would look great in a Fiero.||||reg||1
